     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div>Hi, <br></div><div><br></div><div>I have a problem related to one of the plots of &quot;small worldness&quot;<br></div><div><br></div><div>The code is the following <br></div><div><br></div><div><div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border-color:rgb(187,187,187);border-style:solid;border-width:1px\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#000\">ggplot</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">small</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">dt</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">m</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> aes</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">x</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\">density</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> y</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\">value</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> col</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\">interaction</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#606\">Group</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> variable</span><span style=\"color:#660\">),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>                       lty</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\">interaction</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#606\">Group</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> variable</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)))</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">+</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  geom_line</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">size</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#066\">1.25</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">+</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  scale_linetype_manual</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">name</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&#39;Group, type&#39;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>                        labels</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\">mylabels</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">sm</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>                        values</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\">rep</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#066\">3</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> each</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#066\">2</span><span style=\"color:#660\">))</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">+</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  scale_color_manual</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">name</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&#39;Group, type&#39;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>                     labels</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\">mylabels</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">sm</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>                     values</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\">rep</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">c</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&#39;red&#39;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&#39;cyan3&#39;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">3</span><span style=\"color:#660\">))</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">+</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  labs</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">x</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&#39;Density&#39;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> y</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&#39;Clustering coefficient&#39;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span></div></code></div><br> The problem R displays is that <b>small.dt.m can&#39;t be found</b>, neither <b><a href=\"http://mylabels.sm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://mylabels.sm&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792487954496000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0y2fnqAFfzZ40LKL33KvPA\">mylabels.sm</a></b>. I&#39;ve tried to look to the rest of the code but such variable does not appear and I don&#39;t know how to create them.</div><div><br></div><div>Regards, <br></div></div>"
    ]
   ]
