  {
   "id": "av73MDbpBgAJ",
   "from": "Chris Watson",
   "author": "28bb28f8fe8898a5",
   "date": "2018-10-24T20:58:49Z",
   "subject": "Re: [brainGraph-help] Problems when plotting clustering coefficient",
   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "Are you referring to Chapter 12.2 of the User Guide? If so, you are correct and\r<br>have spotted an error. The variable should be called &quot;small.tidy&quot; as it was\r<br>created in an earlier code block. It is created as follows:\r<br>\r<br>small.tidy &lt;- melt(small.dt, id.vars=c(&#39;density&#39;, &#39;Group&#39;, &#39;N&#39;))\r<br>\r<br>Of course, this variable can be called whatever you prefer, as long as you are\r<br>consistent.\r<br>\r<br>Regarding &quot;<a href=\"http://mylabels.sm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://mylabels.sm&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792487954497000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2SN3Dk_Z_YlrYa1LyeZF1u\">mylabels.sm</a>&quot;,\r<br>\r<br><a href=\"http://mylabels.sm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://mylabels.sm&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792487954497000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2SN3Dk_Z_YlrYa1LyeZF1u\">mylabels.sm</a> &lt;- small.dt.m[, levels(interaction(Group, variable))]\r<br><a href=\"http://mylabels.sm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://mylabels.sm&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792487954497000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2SN3Dk_Z_YlrYa1LyeZF1u\">mylabels.sm</a> &lt;- gsub(&#39;\\\\.Cp&#39;, &#39;, Cp&#39;, <a href=\"http://mylabels.sm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://mylabels.sm&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792487954497000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2SN3Dk_Z_YlrYa1LyeZF1u\">mylabels.sm</a>)\r<br><a href=\"http://mylabels.sm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://mylabels.sm&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792487954497000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2SN3Dk_Z_YlrYa1LyeZF1u\">mylabels.sm</a> &lt;- gsub(&#39;Cp\\\\.&#39;, &#39;&#39;, <a href=\"http://mylabels.sm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://mylabels.sm&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792487954497000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2SN3Dk_Z_YlrYa1LyeZF1u\">mylabels.sm</a>)\r<br>\r<br>Note however that this is specific to plotting both the &quot;simple&quot;- and MC-based\r<br>approaches to generate random graphs, as shown in Figure 12.1\r<br>\r<br>Let me know if this works,\r<br>Chris\r<br>\r<br>On Wed, Oct 24, 2018 at 03:10 AM, Lucia &lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">luci...@gmail.com</a>&gt; wrote:\r<br>\r<br>&gt; from: Lucia &lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">luci...@gmail.com</a>&gt;\r<br>&gt; date: Wed, Oct 24 01:10 AM -07:00 2018\r<br>&gt; to: brainGraph-help &lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">brainGr...@googlegroups.com</a>&gt;\r<br>&gt; reply-to: <a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">brainGr...@googlegroups.com</a>\r<br>&gt; subject: [brainGraph-help] Problems when plotting clustering coefficient\r<br>"
    ],
    [
     2,
     "&gt; \r<br>&gt; Hi, \r<br>&gt; \r<br>&gt; I have a problem related to one of the plots of &quot;small worldness&quot;\r<br>&gt; \r<br>&gt; The code is the following \r<br>&gt; \r<br>&gt; ggplot(small.dt.m, aes(x=density, y=value, col=interaction(Group, variable),\r<br>&gt;                        lty=interaction(Group, variable))) +\r<br>&gt;   geom_line(size=1.25) +\r<br>&gt;   scale_linetype_manual(name=&#39;Group, type&#39;,\r<br>&gt;                         labels=<a href=\"http://mylabels.sm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://mylabels.sm&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792487954498000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1JtPvhW6rDj5WZeYrf0mXg\">mylabels.sm</a>,\r<br>&gt;                         values=rep(1:3, each=2)) +\r<br>&gt;   scale_color_manual(name=&#39;Group, type&#39;,\r<br>&gt;                      labels=<a href=\"http://mylabels.sm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://mylabels.sm&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792487954498000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1JtPvhW6rDj5WZeYrf0mXg\">mylabels.sm</a>,\r<br>&gt;                      values=rep(c(&#39;red&#39;, &#39;cyan3&#39;), 3)) +\r<br>&gt;   labs(x=&#39;Density&#39;, y=&#39;Clustering coefficient&#39;)\r<br>&gt; \r<br>"
    ],
    [
     1,
     "&gt;  The problem R displays is that *small.dt.m can&#39;t be found*, neither \r<br>&gt; *<a href=\"http://mylabels.sm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://mylabels.sm&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792487954498000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1JtPvhW6rDj5WZeYrf0mXg\">mylabels.sm</a>*. I&#39;ve tried to look to the rest of the code but such variable \r<br>"
    ],
    [
     2,
     "&gt; does not appear and I don&#39;t know how to create them.\r<br>&gt; \r<br>&gt; Regards, \r<br>&gt; \r<br>"
    ],
