    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div>Hi, <br></div><div><br></div><div>I&#39;ve tried to used what you told me but R displays</div><div><br></div><div><i><span style=\"color:rgb(255,0,0)\">Error: Insufficient values in manual scale. 20 needed but only 6 provided.</span></i></div><div><br></div><div>This, I understand, is because it uses every variable, not the ones I want to use (&quot;Control, Cp&quot;, &quot;Patient, Cp&quot;, &quot;Control, rand&quot;, &quot;Patient, rand&quot;, &quot;Control, latt&quot;, &quot;Patient, latt&quot;) to plot the graph. Finally what I&#39;ve done is the following:</div><div><br></div><div><div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border-color:rgb(187,187,187);border-style:solid;border-width:1px\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#000\">small</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">m </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> data</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">frame</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">small</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">dt$density</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> small</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">dt$N</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> small</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">dt$Cp</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> small</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">dt$Cp</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">rand</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> small</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">dt$Cp</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">latt</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> small</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">dt$Group</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>colnames</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">small</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">m</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> c</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;density&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;N&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;Cp&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;rand&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;latt&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;Group&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>small</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">dt</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">m </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> melt</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">small</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">m</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> id</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">vars</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\">c</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&#39;density&#39;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&#39;Group&#39;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&#39;N&#39;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">))</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>mylabels</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">sm </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> c</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;Control, Cp&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;Patient, Cp&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;Control, rand&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;Patient, rand&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;Control, latt&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;Patient, latt&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span></div></code></div></div></div>"
    ],
    [
     2,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border-color:rgb(187,187,187);border-style:solid;border-width:1px\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br><br>ggplot</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">small</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">dt</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">m</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> aes</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">x</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\">density</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> y</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\">value</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> col</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\">interaction</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#606\">Group</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> variable</span><span style=\"color:#660\">),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>                       lty</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\">interaction</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#606\">Group</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> variable</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)))</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">+</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  geom_line</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">size</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#066\">1.25</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">+</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  scale_linetype_manual</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">name</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&#39;Group, type&#39;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>                        labels</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\">mylabels</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">sm</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>                        values</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\">rep</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#066\">3</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> each</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#066\">2</span><span style=\"color:#660\">))</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">+</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  scale_color_manual</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">name</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&#39;Group, type&#39;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>                     labels</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\">mylabels</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">sm</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>                     values</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\">rep</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">c</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&#39;red&#39;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&#39;cyan3&#39;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">3</span><span style=\"color:#660\">))</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">+</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  labs</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">x</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&#39;Density&#39;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> y</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&#39;Clustering coefficient&#39;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span></div></code></div></div></div>"
    ],
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border-color:rgb(187,187,187);border-style:solid;border-width:1px\"><code><div></div></code></div><br><br></div><div>What this code does is select from the main data frame small.dt, the varibles of interest. Then, I assign the column names and create small.dt.m (with the same code you created small.tidy). I also set the labels (the code you gave me creates the labels for all the variables not the ones you display on the image of the manual). <br></div><div><br></div><div>This code works perfectly. Thanks for your help!<br></div></div>"
